        },
        "texto": "See also Matthew 9:9; Mark 2:14. The publicani were an influential section of the Roman knights, an ancient order who occupied a kind of middle rank between the senators and the people. These, however, are not mentioned in the New Testaments. The “publicans” so frequently referre…"
